  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overseas Aid Gift Deduction Scheme (2021-23)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OAGDS 2021-23
 The Overseas Aid Gift Deduction Scheme (OAGDS) enables approved Australian organisations to issue tax deductible receipts for donations made to support their overseas aid activities. The funding under this investment is for the provision of assessment services by independent specialists for OAGDS applications.</narrative>
  </description>
